 "remarks": "Absolutely beautiful, fully updated apartment. This sunny and spacious one-bedroom has it all! Located on the second floor of a two-story building in the desirable Turn of River neighborhood. The open kitchen features white cabinetry, quartz countertops, and a dishwasher. The living room/dining room combination is perfect for easy entertainment and includes a balcony and a built-in fireplace. The generously sized bedroom offers ample closet space. The bathroom has a window, additional storage, and a walk-in shower. Washer and dryer are conveniently located in the unit. Flexible terms available. Available furnished for additional $150 per month. Don't miss this opportunity!",
